{"ticker":"GRASIM","symbol":"GRASIM","instrumentId":3022923,"name":"Grasim Industries","industry":"NSE-Bldg-Constr Prds/Misc","about":"Grasim Industries Ltd., part of the Aditya Birla Group, is a diversified conglomerate with leadership across sectors like cellulosic fibres, chemicals, and fashion yarn. textile manufacturer, Grasim has evolved into a global player, with a strong presence in the Indian market. Through subsidiaries like UltraTech Cement and Aditya Birla Capital, Grasim is a major cement producer and financial services provider. Recently, it expanded into the paints industry with its ‘Birla Opus’ brand and launched the B2B marketplace ‘Birla Pivot’ for building materials. In FY 2024, Grasim reported ₹1,30,978 Cr. in consolidated revenue and continues to focus on sustainable growth.","website":"www.grasim.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:23:40.631Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":3111.1,"changePct":1.6035271064663588,"week52High":3380.5,"week52Low":2531.1},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹2,11,717 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,94,234 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"374,286,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"903"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"220,129,980"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.32%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.05"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"152.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.04"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-11%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"43.01"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"14–48"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"4.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-261.68"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,195,775"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"649,447"},{"label":"Master score","value":"50"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"30"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"64"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"126"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"D-